{"thread":{"threadID":3941,"boardID":166,"topic":"Map Vorschläge MG","time":1480122324,"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","lastPostTime":1480424213,"lastPoster":"CyberTroniX","replies":7,"views":597,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[{"tagID":974,"name":"CS GO"},{"tagID":106,"name":"mg"}],"posts":[{"postID":53032,"threadID":3941,"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","subject":"Map Vorschläge MG","time":1480122324,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo,<br>und zwar habe ich gemerkt das in den letzten Tagen neue Maps erschienen sind (Minigame Server).<br>Daher habe ich ein paar Map Vorschläge:<br>DC Course; <a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=413756242&amp;amp;searchtext=dc+course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br>Devil Course; <a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=494840761&amp;amp;searchtext=Devil+course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br>Paul Minecraft Course; <a href=\"http://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=622164992&amp;amp;searchtext=Pauls+minecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53033,"threadID":3941,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1480123079,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2356-derxxlmario/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@DerXXLMario</a>,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>die Maps werden bald von mir überprüft und gegebenfalls auf den Minigame Server gepackt.<br>Danke für den Vorschlag.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53034,"threadID":3941,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1480125596,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1480166030,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Mal wieder der Hinweis:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/3259-wie-schlage-ich-am-besten-maps-vor/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Wie schlage ich am besten Maps vor?</a></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53058,"threadID":3941,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1480180834,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sollte man vielleicht anpinnen im Bereich ...</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53065,"threadID":3941,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1480184179,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>wickedy</strong></cite><p>Sollte man vielleicht anpinnen im Bereich ...<br></p></blockquote><p>Ich weiß nicht, ob ich zu langsam war und es jemand vorhin gemacht hat, oder es vorher schon angepinnt war, aber es ist nun auf jeden Fall angepinnt <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53072,"threadID":3941,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1480189246,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>#ot</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>es ist schon immer pinned gewesen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53152,"threadID":3941,"userID":262,"username":"Deagletrix","subject":"","time":1480366987,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich finde es sind schon genug course maps drauf und außerdem ist es ein Minigame Server und kein course server</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":53168,"threadID":3941,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1480424213,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Um genau zu sein ist es ein Minigame <strong>und </strong>Course Server.<br>Davor hatten wir einen seperaten Course Server, welcher aber runter genommen und dem Minigame Server hinzugefügt wurde.</p>","polls":[]}]}